    "answer": "D",
    "explanation": "答案: (D)\n(A)依照 Cleopatra study 及 PERUSE study，第一線的標準治療是Taxane (Docetaxel or Paclitaxel)\n+Trastuzumab+Pertuzumab。>>正確\nStudy N Experimental\narm\nActive Comparator Primary\nendpoin\nt\nSecondar\ny\nendpoint\nResult\nCleopatra\nstudy\n808 Pertuzumab\n+trastuzumab\n+docetaxel\nplacebal\n+trastuzumab\n+docetaxel\nPFS OS TPH vs TH\nPFS:18.7 vs 12.4 month\nOS: 56.5 vs 40.8 months\nPERUSE\nstudy\n1436 Docetaxel\n+trastuzumab\n+pertuzumab\nnab-paclitaxel/\npaclitaxel\n+trastuzumab\n+pertuzumab\nsafety PFS\nOS\npaclitaxel is a valid\nalternative to docetaxel\nas backbone\nchemotherapy\n*PERUSE study: first-line pertuzumab plus trastuzumab plus a taxane for HER2-positive locally\nrecurrent or metastatic breast cancer, with a multivariable approach to guide prognostication\nRef: Ann Oncol. 2021 Oct;32(10):1245-1255. doi: 10.1016/j.annonc.2021.06.024. Epub 2021 Jul 2\n* Cleopatra study: combination therapy with docetaxel for first-line treatment of HER2-positive\nmetastatic breast cancer in the Clinical Evaluation of Pertuzumab and Trastuzumab (CLEOPATRA)\ntrial\nRef: February 19, 2015 ,N Engl J Med 2015; 372:724-734, DOI: 10.1056/NEJMoa1413513\n* Reference: NCCN Guidelines Version 1.2023 Breast Cancer, MS-64\n\n(B)因 Destiny-Breast 03 study 結果，Trastuzumab-deruxtecan 療效已經優於TDM-1，成為標準第\n二線治療。>> 正確\nStudy N Experimental\narm\nActive\nComparator\nPrimary\nendpoint\nSecondary\nendpoint\nResult\nDESTINY-Breast03 524 Trastuzumab\nderuxtecan\n(T-DXd)\nAdo-trastuzumab\nemtansine\n(T-DM1)\nProgression-Free\nSurvival (PFS)\n1. Overall\nSurvival (OS)\n2. Objective\nResponse\nRate (ORR)\n3. Duration of\nResponse\n(DoR)\nT-DXd vs T-DM1\nPFS: 28.8 vs\n6.8(p<0.0001)\nOS: both not\nreached\nORR: 94.1% vs\n86.0%\nDoR: 36.6 vs\n23.8 month\n*DESTINY-Breast03: Trastuzumab deruxtecan versus trastuzumab emtansine in patients with\nHER2-positive metastatic breast cancer: updated results from DESTINY-Breast03, a randomised,\nopen-label, phase 3 trial\n-Summary: An improvement in progression-free survival was shown with trastuzumab deruxtecan\nversus trastuzumab emtansine in patients with HER2-positive metastatic breast cancer in the\nprogression-free survival interim analysis of the DESTINY-Breast03 trial.\n\n* Reference: NCCN Guidelines Version 1.2023 Breast Cancer, BINV-Q 1 OF 4\n(C)使用 TDM-1 常見副作用是Hepatitis 及 Thrombocytopenia。>>正確\n\nReference: DESTINY-Breast03\n(D)在 NALA study，Neratinib+Capecitabine 相較於Lapatinib+Capecitabine 比較，並沒有顯著的\nPFS 或是OS benefit。>>錯誤，PFS 有顯著差異，OS 無．\nStudy N Experimental\narm\nActive\nComparator\nPrimary\nendpoint\nSecondary endpoint Result\nNALA\ntrial\n621 Neratinib\n+Capecitabine\n(N+C)\nLapatinib\n+Capecitabine\n(L+C)\nPFS\nOS\nObjective response rate\n(ORR)\nDuration of response\n(DoR)\nClinical benefit rate (CBR)\nTime to intervention for\nsymptomatic metastatic\ncentral nervous system\n(CNS) disease\nN+C vs L+C\n6m-OS:90.2 vs 87.5%\n12m-OS: 72.5 vs 66.7%(p=0.2)\n6m-PFS:47.2 vs 37.8%\n12m-PFS:28.8 vs\n14.8%(p=0.009)\nORR: 32.8 vs 26.7%\nCBR: 44.5% vs 35.6%\nDoR: HR:0.5,p=0.0004\nTime to intervention for\nsymptomatic CNS disease:\ndelay in N+C\nConclusions: N+C significantly improved PFS with a trend towards improved OS vs L+C. N+C also\nresulted in a delayed time to intervention for symptomatic CNS disease. Tolerability was similar\nbetween the two arms, with no new safety signals observed.\n*Reference: Neratinib plus capecitabine versus lapatinib plus capecitabine in patients with\nHER2-positive metastatic breast cancer previously treated with ≥2 HER2-directed regimens: Findings\nfrom the multinational, randomized, phase 3, NALA trial\n\n(E)使用 Trastuzumab-deruxtecan 需注意 Myelosuppression, emesis, interstitial pneumonitis 副作\n用。\n>>正確，參考選項C 表格\n*Pulmonary toxicity of Trastuzumab-deruxtecan\n-Overall incidence of adjudicated T-DXd-related ILD/pneumonitis was 15.4% (grade 1 or 2, 77.4%;\ngrade 5, 2.2%).\n-Potential risk factors\nage <65 years\nenrollment in Japan\nT-DXd dose >6.4 mg/kg\noxygen saturation <95%\nmoderate/severe renal impairment\npresence of lung comorbidities\ntime since initial diagnosis >4 years\nReference:\n1.Pooled analysis of drug-related interstitial lung disease and/or pneumonitis in nine trastuzumab\nderuxtecan monotherapy studies, DOI:https://doi.org/10.1016/j.esmoop.2022.100554\n2.Trastuzumab Deruxtecan in Previously Treated HER2-Low Advanced Breast Cancer, N Engl J Med\n2022; 387:9-20\n\n題號 答案 題目",
