    "answer": "C",
    "explanation": "《詳解》\n(A)錯，Progression-free survival 皆為 12 個月，該study 的 OS 也是沒差\n(B)錯，PFS 和 OS 都沒差\n(C)對，兩篇都為 positive result\n(D)錯，以下為文中的四個 Trial 小結\n\nJGOG3016\npaclitaxel (180 mg/m(2); 3-h intravenous infusion) plus carboplatin (area under the\ncurve [AUC] 6 mg/mL per min), given on day 1 of a 21-day cycle (conventional\nregimen) dose-dense paclitaxel (80 mg/m(2); 1-h intravenous infusion) given on days\n1, 8, and 15 plus carboplatin given on day 1 of a 21-day cycle (dose-dense regimen)\n=>dose-dense 組 PFS、OS 都有比較好\n\nMITO-7\ncarboplatin (AUC 6 mg/mL per min) plus paclitaxel (175 mg/m(2)) every 3 weeks for six\ncyclescarboplatin (AUC 2 mg/mL per min) plus paclitaxel (60 mg/m(2)) every week for\n18 weeks =>weekly 比起 /3weeks PFS 沒有顯著差異 ， 但 QoL (FACT-O/TOI scores) 比\n較好\n\nICON8\ngroup 1 (carboplatin AUC5 or AUC6 and 175 mg/m2 paclitaxel every 3 weeks),\ngroup 2 (carboplatin AUC5 or AUC6 every 3 weeks and 80 mg/m2 paclitaxel weekly),\ngroup 3 (carboplatin AUC2 and 80 mg/m2 paclitaxel weekly)\n=>weekly 比起 /3weeks PFS 沒有顯著差異\n\nGOG-0262\npaclitaxel, administered intravenously at a dose of 175 mg/m2 every 3 weeks, plus\ncarboplatin\npaclitaxel, administered weekly at a dose of 80mg/m2, plus carboplatin\n=>PFS 沒有比較好\n(E)錯，用 niraparib 這組PFS 有顯著的較好\n題\n號\n答\n案\n題目",
