    "id": "111-Q036",
    "stem": "A 67-year-old man with a history of stage IVA squamous cell carcinoma of lung, PD-L1> 50%.\nHe has been treated with pembrolizumab 200mg Q3W for 8 cycles. He was brought to emergency\nroom due to progressive malaise, lethargy and constipation. His thyroxin level (T4) was 0.02 ug/dl.\nWhich of the following statement is correct for him ?",
    "options": {
      "A": "Hypercalcemia is related to the condition.",
      "B": "Almost every patient will have concurrent adrenal insufficiency.",
      "C": "He must start methylprednisolone 1 mg/Kg/day immediately.",
      "D": "Pembrolizumab should permanently discontinue.",
      "E": "Patient should start cortisol and thyroxin replacement."
    },
    "sourcePage": null,
    "cancer": "Lung",
    "topic": "General",
    "trials": [],
    "answer": "A",
    "explanation": "答案 (A)\n詳解\n(Reference: NCCN Guidelines Version 1.2022 Management of Immune Checkpoint Inhibitor-Related\nToxicities)\n(A) Hypercalcemia is related to the condition.\n→正確，Immune-related adverse events (irAE)應該不會造成高血鈣，不過題幹的症狀應該也要\n檢查看看是否有高血鈣。\n(B) Almost every patient will have concurrent adrenal insufficiency.\n→錯誤(?)，按照答題技巧應該就錯誤。查不到 Immune-related hypothyrodism 和 adrenal\ninsufficiency 同時發現機率的文獻。NCCN guideline 建議在 Immune-related hypothyrodism 要同\n時有沒有 concomitant adrenal insufficiency，補充甲狀腺素後也要定期monitor cortisol level 小心\n有無 secondary adrenal insufficiency。\n(C) He must start methylprednisolone 1 mg/Kg/day immediately.\n→錯誤，題幹之Immune-related hypothyrodism 雖然有症狀但不需要 immunosuppressant，僅需\n補充賀爾蒙即可。\n(D) Pembrolizumab should permanently discontinue.\n→錯誤，題幹之 Immune-related hypothyrodism 雖然有症狀但不需要停 Immune Checkpoint\nBlockade，除非 hypophysitis + pituitary swelling (有頭痛視力模糊等症狀)才需要停。\n(E) Patient should start cortisol and thyroxin replacement.\n→錯誤，在 hypophysitis 才需要同時補充 cortisol 和 thyroxin。但題幹沒有hypothyrodism 的症\n狀。",
