    "answer": "D",
    "explanation": "ANS: D\n(A) CD10 and BCL6 比較容易在GCB type 表現\n(B) interferon response factor 4/MUM1 比較容易在ABC type 表現\n(C) GCB type 比例較高\n(D) DLBCL 表現為CD10-, BCL6+, MUM1+依據 Hans algorithm 為 GCB type\n(E) DLBCL with double expression 大多為 ABC type\n\n*NonGCB = ABC + nonclassified\n GCB ABC\nCell of origin Centroblast Plasmablastic cells (just prior to\ngerminal center exit)\nMain\noncogenic\nmechanisms\n• Histone modification (EZH2)\n• Blocks to terminal differentiation\n(BCL-6 expression, EZH2)\n• Cell cycle activation +/- blocks to\napoptosis (MYC and BCL2\ntranslocation= Double hit and\nprotein overexpression)\n• mTOR pathway activation\n• Signaling cascade (PI3K and AKT\nactivation)\n\n• BCR/NF-KB signaling\n• Histone modification\n• Blocks to terminal translocation\n(BCL-6 expression, PRDM1\nmutation/loss)\n• Cell cycle activation +/-blocks to\napoptosis (MYC and BCL2 protein\noverexpression by different\nmechanism)\n• mTOR pathway activation\n• Signaling cascade: PI3K and AKT\n• Cytokine signaling/JAK-STAT\npathway activation\nMarkers Germinal center B cells: CD10, LMO2,\nBCL6\nLike mature plasma cells:\nMUM1, FOXP1\n(A) 正確 (B) 正確\n(C) GCB(~40%), nonGCB(ABC+unclassified ~60%), nonGCB 應該比 GCB 高??\nReference: N Engl J Med. 2002 Jun 20;346(25):1937-47.\n(D) MUM1(+) 為nonGCB type\n(E) Double hit 僅存在於GCB 中，但題幹為dual expression。Dual expression 在 GCB 跟 ABC 都會\n有表現，但在 ABC subtype 比較常見\nReference: Blood (2015) 125 (1): 22–32.",
