    "id": "111-Q069",
    "stem": "69. ER 陽性早期乳癌的手術後輔助內分泌治療,以下何者敘述正確?\n(1) 停經後即使 Aromatase inhibitor intolerance,osteoporosis,arthralgia,都應該勸病人\n忍耐,好好吃藥,不應該換為 Tamoxifen。\n(2) ER 5% 就不建議輔助內分泌治療。\n(3) Aromatase inhibitor 預防復發效果優於 Tamoxifen。\n(4) ATLAS trial 明確證實:十年的 Tamoxifen 比五年 Tamoxifen 有較好的 OS 及\nDFS。\n(5) ASTRRA trial: 停經前乳癌病患,於輔助化療後加上兩年停經針,合併 Tamoxifen,\n比未用停經針有較好之 DFS 及 OS。",
    "options": {
      "A": "(1)(2)(3)(4)",
      "B": "(3)(4)(5)",
      "C": "(2)(4)",
      "D": "(1)(3)",
      "E": "(4)(5)"
    },
    "sourcePage": null,
    "cancer": "Breast",
    "topic": "Adjuvant/Neoadjuvant",
    "trials": [],
    "answer": "B",
    "explanation": "《詳解》\n(1)錯誤\ntamoxifen 仍為 AI 無法耐受的病人的alternative treatment\n(2)錯誤\nGuidelines for the use of chemotherapy and endocrine therapy recently recommended that\nestrogen receptor (ER) status be considered positive if ≥1% of tumor cells demonstrate\npositive nuclear staining by immunohistochemistry\n(3) 正確\nEBCTCG 的meta-analysis 已說明 Aromatase inhibitors reduce recurrence rates by\nabout 30% (proportionately) compared with tamoxifen。\nLancet . 2015 Oct 3;386(10001):1341-1352.\n(4) 正確\n ATLAS trial include 所有 EBC 的病人，分成adjvant tamoxifen 5 年與10 年，其中針\n對ER positive 的族群分析，在 10 年以後DFS 與 OS 漸漸分開。統計分析中，血栓與\n中風的風險不顯著ischaemic heart disease RR 0· 75 (0· 60–0· 95, p=0· 02)有保護效果,\n須注意會增加endometrial cancer RR 1· 74 (1· 30–2· 34, p=0· 0002)的風險\n\n(5)正確\nASTRRA trial 分析了1282 位停經前EBC 病患，一組術後使用五年Tamoxifen，另一\n組除了五年Tamoxifen 再加上2 年的monthly goserelin 得到結果 5-year DFS rate was\n91.1% in the TAM + OFS group and 87.5% in the TAM-only group (hazard ratio, 0.69;\n95% CI, 0.48 to 0.97; P = .033). The estimated 5-year overall survival rate was 99.4%\nin the TAM + OFS group and 97.8% in the TAM-only group (hazard ratio, 0.31; 95%\nCI, 0.10 to 0.94; P = .029)\n\n題\n號\n答\n案\n題目",
