    "answer": "A",
    "explanation": "《詳解》\n\n(1)正確\n(2)正確\nRxPONDER study 的結論，（Among premenopausal women with one to three positive\nlymph nodes and a recurrence score of 25 or lower, those who received\nchemoendocrine therapy had longer invasive disease–free survival and distant\nrelapse–free survival than those who received endocrine-only therapy, whereas\npostmenopausal women with similar characteristics did not benefit from adjuvant\nchemotherapy）若停經後族群 21-gene (Oncotype Dx) RS < 26 加上化療較無好處\n(3)正確\nreference 2021 CCR study 中結論顯示BCI (H/I) 的病人適合Extend ET (2.5->5 年)可延\n長recurrence free interval [HR 0.34; 95% CI, 0.16-0.73; P = 0.004)\n\nClin Cancer Res . 2021 Jan 1;27(1):311-319.\n(4) 錯誤\n50-gene (Prosigna)目前實證上還未能確定是否在predictive value 上扮演腳色 （OPTIMA trial\n進行中），NanoString BC360 尚未寫入NCCN guideline",
