    "stem": "Regarding to the adjuvant tyrosine kinase treatment for advanced renal cell carcinoma\nafter operation, which trials shows positive result to improve disease free survival, instead\nof clear overall survival benefit:\n(1) SORCE (Sorafenib) (2) ASSURE/E2805 (Sunitinib) (3) PROTECT (Pazopanib) (4) S-TRAC (Sunitinib)\n------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------",
