    "explanation": "答案: (D)\n詳解:整理Anti-VEGF 在RCC 的 trial 如下:\nTrial  Inclusion Intervention DFS\nASSURE >T1b\nClear cell and non-clear cell\nSunitinib x 1 year\nSorafenib x 1 year\nPlacebo\n5.8Y\n6.1Y\n6.6Y\nS-TRAC >T3 or N+\nClear cell\nSunitinib x 1 year\nPlacebo\n6.8Y **\n5.6Y\n(OS not\nreached in\neither arm)\nPROTECT T2 (high grade)\nT3 or N+ clear cell\nPazopanib x 1 year\nPlacebo\nNR\n54M (p=0.165)\nATLAS T2 or N+\nClear cell\nAxitinib x 1 year\nPlacebo\nNR\nNR (p=0.85)\nSORCE Clear cell or non-clear cell\nLeibovich risk model\nintermediate to high risk\nSorafenib x1 year=> Placebo x 2\nyear\nSorafenib x 3 year\nPlacebo x 3 year\nNR in all arms\n(p=0.95)\n\nAnti-VEGF 在 RCC 的 trial 幾乎全軍覆沒，除了 Sunitinib 勉強有DFS benefit(但無 OS benefit)外，\n其餘 Sorafenib, Pazopanib, Axitinib 皆失敗，因此較為重要的trial 為 S-TRAC trial。\n------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------",
