    "stem": "下列何者是 PORTEC (postoperative radiation therapy in endometrial carcinoma) Criteria for\nHigh Intermediate-Risk 的評估項目？\n(1) Age >60 years\n(2) >50% myometrial invasion\n(3) Grade 3 tumor\n(4) Non-endometrioid",
    "options": {
      "A": "(1)(2)(3)",
      "B": "(1)(3)",
      "C": "(2)(4)",
      "D": "(4)",
      "E": "(1)(2)(3)(4)"
    },
    "sourcePage": null,
    "cancer": "GYN",
    "topic": "Metastatic",
    "trials": [],
    "answer": "A",
    "explanation": "答案: (A)\n(1) Age >60 years >>正確\n(2) >50% myometrial invasion\n>正確，≥50% myometrial invasion 也屬於 high risk 表現\nFIGO 1988 stage 1C (≥50% myometrial invasion) with age greater than 60 and grade 1 or 2\nFIGO 1988 stage 1B (<50% myometrial invasion) with age greater than 60 and grade 3\nFIGO 1988 stage 2A (endocervical glandular involvement, which is stage I in FIGO 2009) with\nany age, except for grade 3 with deep invasion\n*Vaginal brachytherapy versus pelvic external beam radiotherapy for patients with endometrial\ncancer of high-intermediate risk (PORTEC-2): an open-label, non-inferiority, randomised trial\n*FIGO stage: International Federation of Gynecology and Obstetrics stage\n(3) Grade 3 tumor >> 正確\n(4) Non-endometrioid >> 錯誤，為 high risk\n*觀念: 子宮內膜癌最重要的治療為手術切除，包含total abdominal or laparoscopic hysterectomy\nand bilateral salpingo-oophorectomy。許多研究顯示對於有risk factor 的 stage I endometrial\ncancer，可藉由external pelvic radiotherapy 減少陰道及骨盆腔復發，然而放射治療並無改善OS，\n且有放射相關副作用產生。PORTEC-2 trial 依據age, stage, histological type, grade, depth of\nmyometrial invasion, presence of lymph-vascular space invasion(LVSI)評估 recurrence 風險，結果顯\n示 high-intermediate risk 病人接受 vaginal brachytherapy 跟接受 pelvic radiotherapy 一樣有效，\n且可減少放射副作用產生。\n補充: FIGO staging",
