    "stem": "關於 Non-small cell lung cancer (NSCLC)的 chemotherapy, 下列說法何者為是?\n(1) Squamous cell carcinoma 的第一線治療藥物以 Pemetrexed+ platinum 為首選。\n(2) 不論是 squamous or non-squamous cell lung cancer, docetaxel 都已經不是第一線的首選藥\n物。\n(3) Bevacizumab 可以搭配化學治療用於各種 NSCLC，以提昇整體反應率。\n(4) 選擇化學治療前，應先確認腫瘤沒有 driver mutations.",
    "options": {
      "A": "(1)(2)(3)",
      "B": "(1)(3)",
      "C": "(2)(4)",
      "D": "(4)",
      "E": "(1)(2)(3)(4)"
    },
    "sourcePage": null,
    "cancer": "Lung",
    "topic": "Biomarker/Targeted therapy",
    "trials": [],
    "answer": "D",
    "explanation": "答案: (D)\n(1) Squamous cell carcinoma 的第一線治療藥物以 Pemetrexed+ platinum 為首選。 >>錯誤。\nPemetrexed+ platinum 為 non-squamous cell carcinoma 首選。Squamous cell carcinoma 首選為\ncisplatin+gemcitabine/docetaxel。\n(2) 不論是 squamous or non-squamous cell lung cancer, docetaxel 都已經不是第一線的首選藥\n物。>>錯誤，docetaxel+platinum 為 squamous cell lung cancer 一線治療。\n\n*Reference: NCCN Guidelines Version 1.2023, Non0Small Cell Lung Cancer, NSCL-E 1 OF 3\n(3) Bevacizumab 可以搭配化學治療用於各種 NSCLC，以提昇整體反應率。 >>錯誤 non\nsquamous\n**Criteria for treatment with bevacizumab: nonsquamous NSCLC, and no recent history of\nhemoptysis.\n*Reference: NCCN Guidelines Version 1.2023, Non0Small Cell Lung Cancer, NSCL-20\n(4) 選擇化學治療前，應先確認腫瘤沒有 driver mutations.>>正確\n*Reference: NCCN Guidelines Version 1.2023, Non0Small Cell Lung Cancer, NSCL-18\n\n題號 答案 題目",
