    "id": "111-Q098",
    "stem": "一位30 歲女性因黃疸來就醫，total bilirubin 8 mg/dL，無發燒。影像檢發現胰臟頭部\n腫瘤壓迫總膽管，懷疑是胰臟癌，下列何者正確?\n(1) 外科評估認為可以手術，術前應先做膽道支架引流至黃疸接近正常\n(2) 在腫瘤分期評估T 和 N 上，內視鏡超音波(EUS)比電腦斷層準\n(3) 手術後病理為pT2N1，可以用 mFOLFIRINOX 降低復發風險至 30%\n(4) 即使家族中沒有人有罹患胰臟癌的病史，也應建議施行基因檢測",
    "options": {
      "A": "(1)(2)(3)",
      "B": "(1)(3)",
      "C": "(2)(4)",
      "D": "(4)",
      "E": "(1)(2)(3)(4)"
    },
    "sourcePage": null,
    "cancer": "GI",
    "topic": "Adjuvant/Neoadjuvant",
    "trials": [],
    "answer": "D",
    "explanation": "答案(D)\n詳解\n(Reference: NCCN Guidelines Version 2.2022 Pancreatic Adenocarcinoma)\n(1) 外科評估認為可以手術，術前應先做膽道支架引流至黃疸接近正常\n→錯誤，根據NCCN guideline PANC-B 原文”Stent placement is not routinely recommended prior to\nplanned surgery; however, a stent may be considered for symptoms of cholangitis/ fever or severe\nsymptomatic jaundice (intense pruritus), or if surgery is being delayed for any reason, including\nneoadjuvant therapy.” 題幹之病患應該可以直接手術。\n(2) 在腫瘤分期評估T 和 N 上，內視鏡超音波(EUS)比電腦斷層準\n→錯誤，根據 NCCN guideline PANC-A 2 OF 8 原文”EUS is not recommended as a routine staging\ntool. In select cases, EUS may be complementary to CT for staging.”\n(3) 手術後病理為pT2N1，可以用mFOLFIRINOX 降低復發風險至 30%\n→錯誤，根據 PRODIGE 24/CCTG PA.6 trial，(Reference: N Engl J Med 2018; 379:2395-2406)\n\n內文提到，a cancer-related event, second cancer, or death occurred in 54.3% in the\nmodified-FOLFIRINOX group and in 73.2% in the gemcitabine group。查了supplement 若只看\nrecurrence event，也是51.4%比68.2%。也頂多可說復發風險降至50%吧。\n另外補充 NCCN Guideline，對於pancreatic adenocarcinoma 的 adjuvant therapy 建議：無論有無\n接受 neoaduvant therapy 還是建議做 adjuvant chemotherapy。\n\nReference: 內科學誌 2022:33:102-109\n(4) 即使家族中沒有人有罹患胰臟癌的病史，也應建議施行基因檢測\n→正確，根據NCCN guideline 原文”Genetic testing for inherited mutations is recommended for any\npatient with confirmed pancreatic cancer, using comprehensive gene panels for hereditary cancer\nsyndromes.”",
